Results:
/internal             (Status: 200) [Size: 8770]

Only one page is returned but that is still an entry way. After going to this page I am given a login form
After going to the login form I tried a basic SQL entry to see if the login form was weak to SQl breaches. 
admin' OR 1=1 -- 
was used and provided me access to the internal dashboard 
In the internal dashboard there are many different options available to pry at such as:
- Host Health 
- Aduit Log 
- Services 
- Internal User Usernames: jmartin, svc-mon, netops 

